     ships the pair: RTGS_pacs_008_sample_CSTPMT_basic pays "Uhrengrosshandel
     Müller" (Dbtr) to "Horlogerie du Joux" (Cdtr), and
     RTGS_pacs_004_sample_FOCR returns that exact UETR with "Horlogerie du Joux"
     under RtrChain/Dbtr. testdata/pacs008_returned_original.xml is the matching
     original for this file, joinable on the UETR. -->
